        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "74ced254-781d-5408-bd41-867d1dddcf23",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Martin Freeman, Corey Johnson, Velibor Topic, Danny Dyer, Andy Bernard, Peter Jackson\n- Works: The Office, Sherlock, The Hobbit film trilogy, Fargo, The All Together\n- Topics: Acting roles, British television, Film releases\n\nFacts:\n- Martin Freeman was born on 8 September 1971 and is an English actor.\n- The Office is a British mockumentary sitcom that was first broadcast in the United Kingdom on BBC Two on 9 July 2001.\n- Martin Freeman became known for portraying Tim Canterbury in the original UK version of The Office.\n- The All Together is a 2007 comedy feature film starring Martin Freeman, Corey Johnson, Velibor Topic, and Danny Dyer.\n- Martin Freeman portrayed Dr. John Watson in the British crime drama Sherlock.\n- Martin Freeman portrayed Bilbo Baggins in Peter Jackson's The Hobbit film trilogy.\n- Martin Freeman portrayed Lester Nygaard in the dark comedy-crime drama TV series Fargo.\n- Andy Bernard has no counterpart in the original British version of The Office.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
